      "fill": "$text-2",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1440,
      "content": "AG1 · Conversation proportions (58, 59, 73). Replies and tool rows share a 720 pt reading column with the composer, centred in the window. Sam's bubble is right-aligned and wide (up to 80% of the column, 576 pt). Tool rows stay on the panel tone — a step off the window, darker than the bubble. Body 15 pt regular, bold 600, bullets full-size in the text colour. An MCP row names its tool once: \"memory · query documents\". The strip keeps the model and services; context is on the session card (64). The card's hint says what the buttons do (65).",
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "fontFamily": "$font",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
