      "width": 1440,
      "content": "AG2 · Viewer and Files (68, 69, 70, 61). Front matter is a quiet, foldable Properties block at the top — key on the left, value on the right, tags as small chips; never a heading. Open in Obsidian sits beside Open externally when the file is inside a vault (a parent with .obsidian/). Files: the switch reads Folders; Changed this session uses the folder list's row exactly — same inset, icon, size and spacing — with the time trailing quietly. Conversation at the AG1 sizes.",
