                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The dot carries the state. A second line appears only when it says something: the gateway's port, or an error in red. Healthy services are one line. One Restart all at the foot; while a turn runs it asks first (AC1). No per-row buttons, no developer footer.",
