      "fill": "$text-2",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 860,
      "content": "AG5 · Queued message (74). While Acme works the composer stays usable. Send queues the message: it waits above the composer — \"Queued — sends when Acme finishes\" — editable and cancellable until it goes, then appears in the conversation as Sam's next message. More than one stack in order.",
